# REST

## Login
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "",
    "password": "",
    "rememberMe": false
}

###

## Register
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "firstname": "",
    "lastname": "",
    "email": "",
    "password": ""
}

###

## Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": ""
}

###

## Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE